{"article_ids": ["461a81e08dcc750a"], "canonical_title": "ChatAtom: A Multi-Agent LLM System for Molecular Dynamics Simulation and Visualization", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.75, "description": "The paper announces ChatAtom, a multi‑agent large language model system designed to streamline molecular dynamics (MD) studies. It translates user intents into reliable MD input scripts, orchestrates execution of simulations, and generates visualizations, consolidating steps that traditionally required separate expert‑driven tools.", "entities": ["term:md"], "first_seen": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "id": "evt_461a81e08dcc750a", "importance_score": 6.34, "last_updated": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-ai"]}
{"article_ids": ["f33aa1721d852325"], "canonical_title": "LEAN: Library-Based Adaptation for Asynchronous, Federated Fine-Tuning", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.6, "description": "The paper presents LEAN, a method that replaces simple averaging of locally trained low‑rank adapters in federated fine‑tuning with a library‑based approach designed for cross‑device settings where participants have heterogeneous data and join or leave asynchronously. The authors argue that averaging is unstable because adapters are not identifiable up to permutation and can be uninformative when data differ.", "entities": ["term:lean"], "first_seen": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "id": "evt_f33aa1721d852325", "importance_score": 6.19, "last_updated": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-lg"]}
{"article_ids": ["a3e0bef82b0da509"], "canonical_title": "Multi-Tier Edge Triage: Optimizing Latency for Safe Clinical Agents", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.78, "description": "The paper introduces a Multi‑Tier Edge Triage system that places parts of generative AI agent processing at the network edge to enforce safety and compliance (HIPAA PHI protection, scope‑of‑practice limits, patient‑appropriate reading level, brand integrity) while meeting interactive latency requirements. It reduces reliance on synchronous outbound calls to cloud LLM judges, which add latency, by handling policy checks locally before optional cloud verification.", "entities": ["model:phi", "term:hipaa", "term:phi"], "first_seen": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "id": "evt_a3e0bef82b0da509", "importance_score": 6.09, "last_updated": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-lg"]}
{"article_ids": ["14a959238623f243"], "canonical_title": "MixFold: Sub-4-Bit Mixed-Precision LLM Inference via Output-Channel Grouping on Mobile NPUs", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.7, "description": "The paper introduces MixFold, a technique that groups output channels to allow mixed‑precision inference (3‑bit and symmetric 2‑bit) on mobile neural‑processing units (NPUs). It addresses the fact that sub‑4‑bit quantization can reduce memory but often does not speed up decoding because NPU matrix units only support a few native integer types and converting unsupported weight formats incurs overhead. By ensuring each matrix‑unit tile uses a single datatype through output‑channel grouping, MixFold preserves the speed benefits of lower‑bit weights.", "entities": [], "first_seen": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "id": "evt_14a959238623f243", "importance_score": 6.04, "last_updated": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-ai"]}
{"article_ids": ["ba63b85712814233"], "canonical_title": "Beyond Final Answers: Interpretable Tumor Immune Microenvironment Reasoning from H&E and mIF", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.6, "description": "Researchers propose a multimodal large language model that combines hematoxylin‑eosin (H&E) histology images with multiplex immunofluorescence (mIF) cell‑phenotype data to automate tumor immune microenvironment (TIME) readouts such as CD8+ T‑cell density and Ki67 index, addressing the prior limitation of pathology MLLMs that only process H&E images.", "entities": ["term:time"], "first_seen": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "id": "evt_ba63b85712814233", "importance_score": 5.99, "last_updated": "2026-11-23T05:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-ai"]}
